The legal text is the Constitution of the State of Montana and Titles 35, 45 and 70 of the Montana Code Annotated 2025, published by the Legislative Services Division at https://mca.legmt.gov/. MCA 1-11-304 provides that the Montana Code Annotated, as published, is the property of the State and may not be copyrighted; statutes are in any case not copyrightable (Georgia v. Public.Resource.Org, Inc., 590 U.S. 255 (2020)). The text is republished unaltered in its wording, with credit to the Legislative Services Division as its publisher.

